        <head>"THE LAND" BOOK.</head>
        <p>"THE LAND" BOOK.</p>
        <p>"It is the biggest piece of work, I think, of the kind done in my day in Great Britain. Look out for the book. It is worth studying, but it will take some time."—Mr. Lloyd George.</p>
