        <p>A (air muster of local rods visited the GowY last week-end, but there were no weighers. Ont local angler took as many as ten roach, not one of which could draw the scale at 11b., the heaviest being about 15oz. This is quite out 01 the common for ten roach in one catch at thil</p>
