        <p>weekly. This at least will do the stream 8004 good, for they were getting quite numerous, an&lt; were spoiling several favourite spots. There one pike reported to be near the Shaker Bridg' that is seen weekly by our anglers. His weiglil estimated at 12.1 b. or 141 b. This would e 51 better Marked up on the catch list than in till stream.</p>
        <p>There is no doubt the dredger has driven till fish from their favourite haunts and at presenl they want some finding, but it will be bettel for the angler in the future. The banks will bl</p>
