      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-02-14_WidnesExaminer_art0120" n="art0120">
        <head>Startling Kidney Cure.</head>
        <p>Startling Kidney Cure.</p>
        <p>Man of 76 avoids threatened , Operation by taking DR. CASSELL'S TABLETS.</p>
        <p>It would hardly be possible to suffer more severely from kidney trouble than did Mr. Thomas Moore, of 114, Lane Head. Rastrick, Brighouse. He says: " Dr. Cassell'- have been worth their weight in gold to me for kidney disease. I was in awful pain at times, and so weak that I could not cross the floor without assistance. I was told that I had stone in the kidneys, and that the only remedy was operation. I am seven- ty-six and I thought an operation would mean the end of Sne, so I got some , aofa d the Dr. rCetslint s e IcompleteTablets, cure without lloore,Brighouse. • opera- tion. To-day I look more like ,sixty-six than seventy-six." • Cure after cure, even in the worst cases, prove Dr. Cassell's Tablets to be the surest remedy ever devised for Nervous Breakdown, Antemia, Debility, Sleeplessness, Nerve Pains, Heart Weakness, Kidney and Stomach Disorders, Children's Weakness, Spinal and Nerve Paraly- sis, general vital exhaustion, brain fag, and all run-down conditions. Send 2d. to-day to Dr. Cassell's Co., jitd., 418, Chester-road, Manches- ter, for a free sample. All Chemists sell Dr. Cassell's Tablets at lOid. Is. lid., and 2s. 9d.— the 2s. 9d. size being the most economical.</p>
