        <p>• lieutenant in 1846. He joined the Ganges b.Y order of the Admiralty in 1849 and served until 1852 in the Mediterranean. He was on board the Victory until he left the Navy in 1853. The: he became identified with the Army, enterT: the Ist Royal Cheshire Militia. During t' 0'</p>
