      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-02-14_WidnesExaminer_art0234" n="art0234">
        <head>SEVEN YEARS OF MISERY</head>
        <p>SEVEN YEARS OF MISERY</p>
        <p>How This Woman was Restored to Health by Lydia</p>
        <p>E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound.</p>
        <p>"For seven years I suffered everything. Often I was in bed for four or five - days at a time, and so weak I could hardly walk. I had cramps, backache and headache, and was so nervous and weak that I dreaded to see anyone or 'lave anyone move in the room. The doe. tors gave me medicine</p>
        <p>to ease me at those</p>
        <p>times, and said that I ought to have a surgical operation. I would not listen to that, and when a friend of my husband's told him about Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound and what it had done for his wife, I was willing to take it. Now I look the picture of health and feel like it, too. I can do all my own housework, work in the garden and entertain and enjoy company, and can walk as far in a day as most women. I wish I could speak to every sufienng woman and girl, and tell them what Lydia E. Pinkharn's Vegetable Compound has done for me." (Name and address on request). Proof is abundant and convincing, showing that after all other means have failed Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound helps women who are troubled with displacements, inilammation, ulcera- tion, tumours, back.,che, that bearing-di mm -feeling, indigestion, and nervous prostra- tion. Why don't you try it? Vt rite to-nay tor a tree priv .te book (to women only) to the Lady Manager, the Lydia E. Pinkham Medicine Co., 42a Hampstead Road, London' N.W. For 2s. 9d. she will send you a bottle of the Lydia E. Pinkham Vegetable Compound, or for 4s. 6(1. a much laroer bottle. .Any chemist will simply it at these prices.</p>
