        <p>The use of ammonia bombs to extiel forest fires is being tested in some national forests of America. In the ea brush fires, the fire fighters often have diffi in getting near enough to beat out the fi and ammonia bombs have been found very tive. The explosion of a single bomb tinguish fire in a 15ft. circle about it.</p>
        <p>A German mathematician named Fred has just published a book entitled "Ist es , dass 2x 2 equals 4 ist." (Is is true that equals 4?) The first volume is out and hl pages; others are to follow. The axim Euclid have been attacked by mathemati and there are shelves full of books provini ,they are false. But this is probably tlo assault upon the multiplication table.</p>
