        <p>Births. WILIirNSON.—On Thursday, 12th ' February,' at " Anateys," Alexandra-road. Stockton Heath, to Mr. and Mrs. Joseph Wilkinson, a daughter.</p>
        <p>Deaths. WAREING.—At the Poplars, Grappenhall, on, Monday, February 9, Frederick William Wareing, aged 49 years. Interred Farnworth Church, Ilth instant. MARLOW.—February 3rd, at 247, Liverpool-road, Ann Marlow, aged 90 years. HOLLAND.—February lath, at 239, lintrtsford- road, John Holland, aged Si years.</p>
